                                "sense_id": "205243b5-84f7-3ef3-8d8a-5e4ddc185424",
                                "text": "Correspond à n'importe quel caractère ne faisant pas partie de ceux qui sont entre les crochets, après le caret (ici, tout caractère sauf a, b, et c).",
                                "translation": "Corresponds to any character that is not part of those inside the brackets, after the caret (here, any character but a, b, or c).",
                                "english": "Corresponds to any character that is not part of those inside the brackets, after the caret (here, any character but a, b, or c)."
                            },
